From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Regenerate the app-server JSON schemas for the patch queue
 (part 2 of 4)

Generator output for the whole patch queue on rust-v0.172.0, produced by running upstream's app-server-schema, config-schema, hooks-schema and bazel-lock generators locally with the commands of baseline-platform-lints.yml. See regenerated-outputs/README.md. The schema files are split across four patches to stay under the repository's blob size limit; part 1 holds the top-level request, notification and v2 bundle schemas, part 2 the full bundle schema, and parts 3 and 4 the v2 per-type schemas.
---
 .../codex_app_server_protocol.schemas.json    | 2458 ++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 1221 insertions(+), 1237 deletions(-)

